msgid "How to read this manual"
msgstr "如何阅读本手册"

msgid ""
"This manual is organized as follows: The next chapter gives an overview of "
"the general structure of Molpro . It is essential for the new user to read "
"this chapter, in order to understand the conventions used to define the "
"symmetry, records and files, orbital spaces and so on. The later chapters, "
"which describe the input of the individual program modules in detail, assume"
" that you are familiar with these concepts. The appendices describe details "
"of running the program, and the installation procedure."
msgstr ""
"本手册的组织结构如下：下一章概述了Molpro的一般结构。新用户必须阅读本章，以理解用于定义对称性、记录和文件、轨道空间等的约定。后续章节详细描述了各个程序模块的输入，假定您已熟悉这些概念。附录描述了运行程序的细节以及安装过程。"

msgid ""
"Throughout this manual, words in ``Typewriter Font`` denote keywords "
"recognized by Molpro. In the input, these have to be typed as shown, but may"
" be in upper or lower case. Numbers or options which must be supplied by the"
" user are in *italic*. In some cases, various different forms of an input "
"record are possible. This is indicated as :math:`[`\\ *options*\\ :math:`]`,"
" and the possible options are described individually in subsequent "
"subsections."
msgstr ""
"在本手册中，\\ ``Typewriter Font`` "
"中的单词表示Molpro识别的关键字。在输入中，这些必须按所示键入，但可以使用大写或小写。必须由用户提供的数字或选项以\\ *斜体*\\ "
"表示。在某些情况下，输入记录可能有多种不同的形式。这表示为 :math:`[`\\ *options*\\ :math:`]`\\ "
"，可能的选项将在后续小节中单独描述。"
